+</style>
+</head>
+<body>
+<header><small>First Watch Security Services</small>ISSOBS</header>
+<main>
+    <div class="box">
+        <h1><span class="dot"></span>You're offline</h1>
+        <p class="lead">This page needs the ISSOBS server, which can't be reached from this device right now. It opens by itself as soon as the connection is back.</p>
+        <p class="page" id="page"></p>
+
+        <h2>Your work</h2>
+        <ul>
+            <li>Everything saved before the connection dropped is safe on the server.</li>
+            <li>If you pressed Save just as the connection dropped, check the list (receipts, invoices…) once you're back before entering it again. Pressing Save again on the same form never saves it twice.</li>
+            <li>Invoices, proformas, receipts, fuel and maintenance forms keep a draft on this device as you type.</li>
+        </ul>
+        <div id="drafts"></div>
+        <div id="outbox"></div>
+
+        <h2>Still works without internet</h2>
+        <ul>
+            <li>Guard sign-in (scan the QR poster) and the supervisor kiosk: sign-ins are saved on the phone and sent automatically.</li>
+            <li>The draft forms above, if they were opened on this device before.</li>
+        </ul>
+
+        <h2>Check</h2>
+        <ul>
+            <li>Is Wi-Fi or mobile data on? Try opening another website.</li>
+            <li>Other websites open but ISSOBS doesn't: the server may be down. Tell your administrator.</li>
+            <li>Nothing opens: restart the router, or switch to mobile data.</li>
+        </ul>
+
+        <div class="foot">
+            <span class="status" id="status">Checking the connection every 10 seconds…</span>
+            <button class="ghost" type="button" onclick="history.back()">Go back</button>
